      "widgets_values": [
        0,
        "\"Quick brown foxes jump past vivid blue gates while cheerful children whisper strange jokes and quietly chew crunchy snacks. \"\n\"Peter packed five bright red boxes, then waved goodbye as George slowly drove his shiny yellow van around the narrow corner.\"\n\"Maggie bought seven fresh peaches, warm bread, and a jar of blackberry jam before walking quickly through the busy market. \"\n\"Victor smiled, brushed the crumbs from his jacket, and asked whether she wanted coffee or juice.\"\n\"Benjamin carefully zipped his heavy green jacket while Zoe searched beneath the couch for her missing purple gloves.\"\n\"Please bring three large bowls, six clean forks, and enough chocolate pudding for everyone at the party.\"\n\"Rachel whispered that the strange little bird had flown through the open window and landed beside the television. \"\n\"James gently reached forward, cupped both hands around it, and carried the frightened creature safely back outside.\"\n\"Thomas grabbed his backpack, checked the weather, and hurried toward the bus stop beneath a bright orange umbrella. \"",
        "[\"nine_scene_selector/1794751668062_kem8h660_01_showcase_00001_.png\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751668062_kem8h660_02_showcase_00002_.png\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751668062_kem8h660_03_showcase_00003_.png\"]",
        "[\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_01_clip_01.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_02_clip_02.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_03_clip_03.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_04_clip_04.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_05_clip_05.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_06_clip_06.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_07_clip_07.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_08_clip_08.wav\",\"nine_scene_selector/1794751676776_fkor715i_09_clip_09.wav\"]"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "index": 0,
        "lines": "\"Quick brown foxes jump past vivid blue gates while cheerful children whisper strange jokes and quietly chew crunchy snacks. \"\n\"Peter packed five bright red boxes, then waved goodbye as George slowly drove his shiny yellow van around the narrow corner.\"\n\"Maggie bought seven fresh peaches, warm bread, and a jar of blackberry jam before walking quickly through the busy market. \"\n\"Victor smiled, brushed the crumbs from his jacket, and asked whether she wanted coffee or juice.\"\n\"Benjamin carefully zipped his heavy green jacket while Zoe searched beneath the couch for her missing purple gloves.\"\n\"Please bring three large bowls, six clean forks, and enough chocolate pudding for everyone at the party.\"\n\"Rachel whispered that the strange little bird had flown through the open window and landed beside the television. \"\n\"James gently reached forward, cupped both hands around it, and carried the frightened creature safely back outside.\"\n\"Thomas grabbed his backpack, checked the weather, and hurried toward the bus stop beneath a bright orange umbrella. \"",
